dhp219:1 starts: A man long absent
dhp219:2 starts: comes home safe from afar.
dhp219:3 starts: His kin, his friends, his companions,
dhp219:4 starts: delight in his return.
dhp247:1 starts: & is addicted to intoxicants,
dhp247:2 starts: digs himself up
dhp247:3 starts: by the root
dhp247:4 starts: right here in this world.
dhp221:1 starts: Abandon anger,
dhp221:2 starts: get beyond every fetter.
dhp221:3 starts: When for name & form
dhp221:4 starts: no sufferings, no stresses, invade.
dhp228:1 starts: There never was,
dhp228:2 starts: nor at present is found
dhp228:3 starts: anyone entirely faulted
dhp228:4 starts: or entirely praised.
dhp229:1 starts: If knowledgeable people praise him,
dhp229:2 starts: having observed him
dhp229:3 starts: to be blameless in conduct, intelligent,
dhp229:4 starts: endowed with discernment & virtue:
dhp234:1 starts: Those restrained in body
dhp234:2 starts: restrained in speech & in mind
dhp234:3 starts: –enlightened–
dhp234:4 starts: are the ones whose restraint is secure.
dhp239:1 starts: Just as a silver smith
dhp239:2 starts: step by
dhp239:3 starts: bit by
dhp239:4 starts: blows away the impurities
dhp240:1 starts: Just as rust
dhp240:2 starts: eats the very iron
dhp240:3 starts: so the deeds
dhp240:4 starts: of one who lives slovenly
dhp244:1 starts: Life’s easy to live
dhp244:2 starts: cunning as a crow,
dhp244:3 starts: corrupt, back-biting,
dhp244:4 starts: forward, & brash;
dhp245:1 starts: but for someone who’s constantly
dhp245:2 starts: scrupulous, cautious,
dhp245:3 starts: pure in his livelihood,
dhp245:4 starts: it’s hard.
dhp249:1 starts: People give
dhp249:2 starts: in line with conviction.
dhp249:3 starts: Whoever gets flustered
dhp249:4 starts: at food & drink given to others,
dhp249:5 starts: attains no concentration
dhp249:6 starts: by day or by night.
dhp250:1 starts: But one in whom this is
dhp250:2 starts: up-rooted
dhp250:3 starts: attains concentration
dhp250:4 starts: by day or by night.
dhp252:1 starts: It’s easy to see
dhp252:2 starts: but hard to see
dhp252:3 starts: You winnow like chaff
dhp252:4 starts: the errors of others,
dhp252:5 starts: but conceal your own–
dhp252:6 starts: like a cheat, an unlucky throw.
dhp256:1 starts: To pass judgment hurriedly
dhp256:2 starts: doesn’t mean you’re a judge.
dhp256:3 starts: The wise one, weighing both
dhp256:4 starts: right judgment & wrong,
dhp257:1 starts: judges others impartially–
dhp257:2 starts: unhurriedly, in line with the Dhamma,
dhp257:3 starts: guarding the Dhamma,
dhp257:4 starts: he’s called a judge.
dhp258:1 starts: Simply talking a lot
dhp258:2 starts: doesn’t mean one is wise.
dhp258:3 starts: Whoever’s secure–
dhp258:4 starts: is said to be wise.
dhp259:1 starts: Simply talking a lot
dhp259:2 starts: doesn’t maintain the Dhamma.
dhp259:3 starts: Whoever
dhp259:4 starts: sees Dhamma through his body,
dhp259:5 starts: is not heedless of Dhamma:
dhp259:6 starts: he’s one who maintains the Dhamma.
